2026-10-16

        * deKorator: port to Qt 6, KDE Frameworks 6 and KDecoration3 (Plasma 6).
        * deKoratorclient.cc: rewrite the KWin glue on top of KDecoration3, the
            theme images are now shared by all decorations in Theme.
        * deKoratorclient.cc: fall back to the installed Default theme when the
            configured theme does not exist.
        * deKoratorclient.cc: drop QImageBlitz, implement the button effects
            locally; Blend and Solarize animations work again.
        * deKoratorconfig.cc: port to KCModule, notify KWin after saving, store
            untranslated keys for the combo box settings.
        * themes: port the theme selector to KNewStuff 6, KIO and KArchive of KF6.
        * install the Default theme.


